==Trivia==
*The name CyberFace may be a pun on ''cyberspace''.
*Like [[Metal Cyclone]] and [[Teacher Cybear]], CyberFace was present in the game data for an indeterminate length of time before it was implemented.
*CyberFace was originally exclusive to [[Steel Visage (Deadly)|Facing Danger]], meaning it was technically an event enemy for some time.
*Prior to [[Version 5.8 Update|Version 5.8]], CyberFace moved at 42 speed rather than 32.

